    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 name": "Big Mags Wanted",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 description": "Fights don’t end when people expect them to.\n\nThey end when someone runs dry.\n\nRight now, the people I’m watching don’t have that problem.\n\nYou’re going to make sure of it.\n\nFind the magazines. The ones that matter.\n\nCustoms. Storage building 11.\n\nYou don’t bring them to me.\n\nYou leave them where they’ll be found.\n\nAfter that, they’re not your concern.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 startedMessageText": "Get the magazines. Place them in storage. Leave clean.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 successMessageText": "Good. That changes who walks away from the next fight.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 completePlayerMessage": "Magazines placed. No contact.",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 declinePlayerMessage": "",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 failMessageText": "",
    "6848f1776be936dd22573866 note": "Acquire high-capacity magazines suited for sustained combat.",

    "520ba9d22db01c3f7b0c3cee": "Recover a 60-round STANAG magazine in raid",
    "6d3f59f5774c02bccbd9c545": "Place the STANAG magazine in Customs storage building 11",
    "ccf627e3c6cd943cc568d156": "Recover a 60-round AK magazine in raid",
